                <note rend="inline" type="source">7601.61/–: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commissioner at Riga</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gade</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Riga</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-02-02T17:00:00+01:36"><hi rendition="#italic">February 2,
                                1920—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received February 3—12:18
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>85. Peace has been signed between Esthonia and Soviet Russia.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gade</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
